---
title: Rhubarb Lip Sync
layout: page
---

<p>
Rhubarb Lip Sync is a free and open-source tool that automatically generates 2D mouth animation from voice recordings.
You can use it for video games, animated cartoons, or any project where you want characters to speak without having to perform manual lip sync.
</p>

<p>
Learn how to <a href="getting-started">get started</a>!
</p>

<h2>Made with Rhubarb Lip Sync</h2>

<p>
Here's a selection of projects that have used Rhubarb Lip Sync to create their mouth animations.
</p>

<div id="madeWithRhubarbCarousel" class="carousel slide" data-bs-ride="carousel">
  <div class="carousel-indicators">
    {% for item in madeWithRhubarb %}
      <button type="button"
        data-bs-target="#madeWithRhubarbCarousel"
        data-bs-slide-to="{{ loop.index0 }}"
        class="{% if loop.index0 == 0 %}active{% endif %}">
      </button>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <div class="carousel-inner">
    {% for item in madeWithRhubarb %}
      <div class="carousel-item{% if loop.index0 == 0 %} active{% endif %}">
        <a href="{{ item.url }}" target="_blank" class="d-block w-100 text-decoration-none" style="color: inherit;">
          <img src="img/{{ item.image }}" class="d-block w-100 img-fluid" alt="{{ item.name }}">
          <div class="carousel-caption d-none d-md-block">
            <h5 class="text-white" style="text-shadow: 0px 0px 3px {{ item.shadowColor }};">{{ item.name }} ({{ item.developer }}, {{ item.releaseYear }})</h5>
            <p style="text-shadow: 0px 0px 3px {{ item.shadowColor }};">{{ item.description }}</p>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <button class="carousel-control-prev" type="button" data-bs-target="#madeWithRhubarbCarousel" data-bs-slide="prev">
    <span class="carousel-control-prev-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="visually-hidden">Previous</span>
  </button>
  <button class="carousel-control-next" type="button" data-bs-target="#madeWithRhubarbCarousel" data-bs-slide="next">
    <span class="carousel-control-next-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="visually-hidden">Next</span>
  </button>
</div>

